maturity dates ranging from November 2026 through February 2029. The notional values of our cross-currency swaps, by hedged currency, as of June 30, 2026 and December 31, 2025, are as follows:\nJUNE 30, 2026 DECEMBER 31, 2025\nEuro $ 504,559 $ 509,187\nCanadian dollar 350,000 350,000\n$ 854,559 $ 859,187\n"}
